{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/259759-edit-reality-temporarily","id":259759,"title":"Edit Reality Temporarily","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-18T08:00:50-07:00","id":259759,"title":"Edit Reality Temporarily","content":"I'd like to give Angels the ability to temporarily edit human structures, like in the Matrix where they can suddenly make walls and such. Is there an existing Numina for this or can you recommend something? Thanks?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/354-pencilboy99","name":"PencilBoy99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T08:02:55-07:00","id":259777,"title":"","content":"Assuming you can't do that with Influence, I imagine the DSG will address something like this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T09:17:18-07:00","id":259795,"title":"","content":"Not that I'm aware of, but since embeds and exploits are just a small effect based on what you still remember before you fall and we have one power who let you possess a building, I can only conclude that the original angelical version should be even more powerful, like changing the entire structure or building new walls.<br /> <br /> Go for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>English is not my native language, sorry guys.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/607-amadeu","name":"Amadeu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T11:25:38-07:00","id":259876,"title":"","content":"For now I'll just use it as Influence, the limits would be that it has to be human-like structures (cars, walls, etc.) and the target can't be observing the change. Also, temporary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/354-pencilboy99","name":"PencilBoy99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-20T07:31:54-07:00","id":261246,"title":"","content":"Amadeu has a point which might be helpful to you. Remember that Ephemeral beings (which Angels are a type of) can not only possess people, but objects, so long as the necessary conditions are met. An angel that possesses an object would, hypothetically, be able to control that object and move it. A common example is a spirit possessing a chair and animating it to walk (or crawl). But a more dramatic and esoteric example might be a hunter Angel possessing an entire apartment building and then forcing all the door's shut. It can spend essence (though it loses points of structure doing so) to ensure the building is able to use it's physical statistics. This ensures that it wouldn't be so easy to force those doors, as they'd have to wrestle with the angel. Meanwhile, he can turn off lights, change security cameras and do many other things.<br /> <br /> While not immediately capable of the kind of dramatic change we see in the deja vu scene in the Matrix, it is more or less a simple affair for an angel to do this, so long as he can apply the Open condition to the building. (It would require the Infrastructure condition first.)<br /> <br /> Combine possession with influence able to repair or add points to structure, if the angel's mission allowed for it (which is up to you as ST), use of essence to enhance the structure once possessed could then perhaps do what you want it to?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-20T07:55:22-07:00","id":261253,"title":"","content":"I will try that!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/354-pencilboy99","name":"PencilBoy99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-20T08:53:51-07:00","id":261276,"title":"","content":"Worth noting that broad-scale reality-warping isn't something that angels do. It's something the <i>Machine</i> does.<br /> <br /> It's an occurrence that generally marks a jump in severity - it means that God is directing Its focused attention on an area and outright <i>changing things</i>.<br /> <br /> Barring that, pre-established instances of the types of effects that constitute the more mystical Concealment Infrastructure like spatial folding and mental tricks can generally produce a similar effect to an outside observer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-20T09:32:19-07:00","id":261296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PencilBoy99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/259759-edit-reality-temporarily?p=261253#post261253\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will try that!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> just go beyond expectations. Instead of just using it on a scene with the players inside an ordinary house, what about staging the grand finale in a prision. Think about all the crazy stuff your angel can do with that and all the possibilities to build a strong and creepy end to your chronicle. You can make this last fight memorable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>English is not my native language, sorry guys.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/607-amadeu","name":"Amadeu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}